  "source_caveats": [
    "Simpl had the most granular GST breakdown of any Indian BNPL — every fee type has CGST/SGST/IGST components.",
    "`settled_amount` is stored as Text — use with care when doing arithmetic.",
    "TDS/TCS are Indian compliance taxes: TDS is deducted by the marketplace from merchant payments, TCS is collected by the marketplace from customers.",
    "`party_billing_state_code` and `customer_billing_state_code` determine CGST/SGST vs IGST applicability.",
    "Historical data only — Simpl ceased operations September 2025 per RBI order.",
    "Some financial amount fields are stored as Text; prefer mapped Decimal columns when available or cast explicitly."
  ],
